  <data name="htmlTextBox1.Value" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;power geez unicode1&amp;quot;; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"&gt;በ{Fields.AmharicName} ከላይ በተጠቀሰው &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;power geez unicode1&amp;quot;; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"&gt;የስራ መደብ ላይ በአሰሪና ሠራተኛ አዋጅ &lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;1156/11 አንቀጽ 30&lt;/span&gt; መሠረት &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;power geez unicode1&amp;quot;; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"&gt;&lt;span style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;እንዲቀጠሩ ከ &lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&lt;span style="mso-tab-count: 3"&gt;{Fields.AssignmentDate}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;ጀምሮ እድል ሲሰጥዎት በደስታ ነው፡፡ የስራ ቦታዎም በ &lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&lt;span style="mso-tab-count: 3"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;ይሆናል፡፡ &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;power geez unicode1&amp;quot;; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"&gt;ተጠሪነትዎ ለ &lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;&lt;span style="mso-tab-count: 4"&gt;{Fields.CurrentDepartement}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;ሲሆን ከዚሁ ጋር በተያያዘው የስራ ዝርዝር መግለጫ ላይ የተዘረዘሩትን ተግባራትና ኃላፊነቶች ይተገብራሉ፡፡ ለተቀጠሩበት የስራ መደብም በኩባንያው የደመወዝ ደረጃና ስኬል ላይ ያሉትን የሚከተሉትን ክፍያዎች ያገኛሉ፡፡ &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</value>
